==English==

===Etymology===
Named after section 187 of the {{w|California Penal Code}}, which defines the offense of murder.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|?}}

# {{lb|en|US}} [[police|Police]] [[code]] for [[murder]], in the State of [[California]].
